---
// The urgent surcharge and the NGO discount, neither priced.
---

<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <article class="rounded-site border-rule bg-bg-elev border p-5">
    <h3 class="text-heading font-heading text-lg font-extrabold">Urgent</h3>
    <p class="text-heading mt-2 font-sans text-2xl font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap">+ surcharge</p>
    <p class="text-muted mt-3 text-sm">For a job that has to jump the queue. The price I send you includes it.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="rounded-site border-rule bg-bg-elev border p-5">
    <h3 class="text-heading font-heading text-lg font-extrabold">NGOs</h3>
    <p class="text-heading mt-2 font-sans text-2xl font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap">Discounted</p>
    <p class="text-muted mt-3 text-sm">
      Registered NGOs and non-profits get a discounted price on every job and always get the launch price on a
      <a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2" href="/websites">
        website
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </article>
</div>
<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl">
  I set each price once I have looked at the problem, because the same symptom can have quite different causes.
</p>
